Package: latexsnipper
Version: 0.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 1019920
Maintainer: SakuraMathcraft <SakuraMathcraft@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SakuraMathcraft/LaTeXSnipper
Description: Cross-platform math OCR workspace and automation service
 LaTeXSnipper supports end-to-end math content workflows:
  - Capture and recognize mathematical content from screenshots
  - Handwrite expressions in a dedicated canvas and convert to LaTeX
  - Edit, export, and send results to integrated applications
  - Automate recognition from local tools or authorized remote devices
 .
 Supports X11 and Wayland subject to desktop compositor screenshot and global-shortcut policies.
